+## 3. Admin patch (apply verbatim, single commit)
+
+Tool refs:
+- `astral-sh/setup-uv` **v10.3.3** = lightweight tag → commit `68559e99cc807c1eb7e9238fd43a15bba460eec2` (`git ls-remote`-verified 2026-10-29). Full-SHA pin per `scripts/ci/check_actions_pinning.py` house rule.
+- `uv` pinned to **0.13.6** via the action's `version:` input — lock-freshness determinism couples the uv resolver version to the committed lock (bump protocol §6).
+- `pyyaml==6.0.3` — current latest (probed 2026-10-29); pinning converts the floating ref into a reviewable one-line bump.
+
+### Hunk 1 — `fast-lint-syntax-preflight` (after the `Setup Python` step, ~L517)
+
+```yaml
+      - name: "Setup uv (R29 #1745 — SHA-pinned per check_actions_pinning house rule)"
+        uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@68559e99cc807c1eb7e9238fd43a15bba460eec2 # v10.3.3
+        with:
+          version: "0.13.6"
+          enable-cache: true
+      - name: Install PyYAML
+        run: uv pip install --system pyyaml==6.0.3
+      - name: Install import-linter (import-contract gate, #1791)
+        run: uv pip install --system -r requirements-dev.lock
+      - name: Lock freshness gate (R29 acceptance item 2 - CI validates lock freshness)
+        run: |
+          set -euo pipefail
+          uv pip compile requirements-dev.txt -o /tmp/fresh.lock --quiet
+          diff <(tail -n +3 /tmp/fresh.lock) <(tail -n +3 requirements-dev.lock)
+```
+
+(replaces current L519 and L521)
