+### Hunk 3 — `agent-loop` (immediately before the `Install PyYAML (dispatcher tier-3 verification dependency)` step, ~L981)
+
+```yaml
+      - name: "Setup uv (R29 #1745)"
+        uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@68559e99cc807c1eb7e9238fd43a15bba460eec2 # v10.3.3
+        with:
+          version: "0.13.6"
+          enable-cache: true
+      - name: Install PyYAML (dispatcher tier-3 verification dependency)
+        run: uv pip install --quiet --system pyyaml==6.0.3
